('animal-8','animal','old','easy','What is a baby cat called?','["A kitten","A puppy","A cub","A calf"]'::jsonb,0,'A baby cat is a kitten.','',''),
('animal-9','animal','old','easy','Which farm animal gives us wool?','["Sheep","Cow","Pig","Horse"]'::jsonb,0,'Sheep grow wool that can be used for clothing.','',''),
('animal-10','animal','old','easy','Which animal is famous for black-and-white stripes?','["Zebra","Horse","Donkey","Cow"]'::jsonb,0,'Zebras have distinctive black-and-white stripe patterns.','',''),
('animal-11','animal','old','easy','What do we call a baby cow?','["A calf","A kid","A cub","A joey"]'::jsonb,0,'A young cow is called a calf.','',''),
('animal-12','animal','old','easy','Which animal says “quack”?','["Duck","Chicken","Goose","Turkey"]'::jsonb,0,'Ducks are known for their quacking sound.','',''),
