('animal-14','animal','old','easy','What do birds use to fly?','["Wings","Fins","Legs","Tails"]'::jsonb,0,'Birds use wings to fly.','',''),
('animal-15','animal','old','easy','Which animal is known for changing its colour to blend in?','["Chameleon","Elephant","Horse","Goat"]'::jsonb,0,'Chameleons can change colour for camouflage and communication.','',''),
