('animal-18','animal','young','easy','Which bird cannot fly but can run very fast?','["Ostrich","Eagle","Sparrow","Owl"]'::jsonb,0,'Ostriches cannot fly but are excellent runners.','',''),
('animal-19','animal','young','easy','What do we call an animal that mainly eats plants?','["Herbivore","Carnivore","Omnivore","Predator"]'::jsonb,0,'Herbivores feed mainly on plants.','',''),
