('space-22','space','young','easy','What is a huge collection of stars, gas and dust called?','["Galaxy","Solar system","Constellation","Moon"]'::jsonb,0,'Galaxies contain stars, gas, dust and other matter.','',''),
('space-23','space','young','easy','What are Saturn’s rings mostly made of?','["Ice and rock","Fire and gas","Water only","Metal only"]'::jsonb,0,'Saturn’s rings contain mostly ice particles and rocky material.','',''),
