('space-28','space','old','medium','About how long does moonlight take to reach Earth?','["About 1.3 seconds","About 1 minute","About 1 hour","About 1 day"]'::jsonb,0,'Light from the Moon takes about 1.3 seconds to reach Earth.','',''),
