('space-33','space','old','medium','What is a meteor often called when it makes a bright streak in the sky?','["Shooting star","Moon beam","Solar wave","Starfall"]'::jsonb,0,'A meteor can look like a shooting star as it burns in the atmosphere.','',''),
('space-34','space','old','medium','Which planet is known for its blue colour and strong winds?','["Neptune","Mercury","Mars","Venus"]'::jsonb,0,'Neptune is a blue ice giant with very fast winds.','',''),
