('number-land-8-medium-2','number','old','medium','A number is increased by 15 and then doubled to give 70. What was the original number?','["20","25","27.5","35"]'::jsonb,0,'Work backward: 70 ÷ 2 = 35, then 35 − 15 = 20.','',''),
